    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_4ef2b378",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: this_faceapp_stuff_is_incredible; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic_positive_reaction; overall-intent-description: The image shows a child holding a stuffed animal with a face that has been digitally altered to resemble the child's face using a face-swapping app. The text overlay reads 'this faceapp stuff is incredible!' The scene is lighthearted and playful, with no indication of toxicity, harm, or hateful content. The meme's intent is to express amazement and delight at the capabilities of face-swapping technology, using the child's innocent and joyful expression to reinforce the positive reaction. There are no disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful elements present in the image or text. The overall intent is to celebrate technological innovation in a fun, non-threatening context.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1cc8cfd8"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
